[{"text": "Hello, English learners, and welcome to EnglishPod. My name is Marco.", "start": 1.5400000000000005, "end": 6.02}, {"text": "And I'm Erika.", "start": 6.32, "end": 6.94}, {"text": "Erika, today we are really excited, right?", "start": 7.44, "end": 9.5}, {"text": "Yeah, we've got a great lesson today all about real English.", "start": 9.68, "end": 13.72}, {"text": "Exactly, English that you hear in movies and TV shows.", "start": 14.02, "end": 17.14}, {"text": "Yeah, speaking of movies, today's podcast takes place at the movies.", "start": 17.34, "end": 22.68}, {"text": "Exactly, and that's why it's so fun today.", "start": 23.02, "end": 24.92}, {"text": "Uh-huh.", "start": 25.16, "end": 25.4}, {"text": "Okay, great. So before we listen to our dialogue, let's take a look at our vocabulary preview.", "start": 25.4, "end": 31.56}, {"text": "Vocabulary preview.", "start": 32.66, "end": 33.9}, {"text": "In today's vocabulary preview, we have two words.", "start": 34.34, "end": 38.46}, {"text": "And the first word is inconsiderate.", "start": 38.64, "end": 41.5}, {"text": "Inconsiderate.", "start": 42.24, "end": 42.88}, {"text": "Inconsiderate.", "start": 43.4, "end": 44.04}, {"text": "So Erika, what is it when someone is inconsiderate?", "start": 44.2, "end": 47.3}, {"text": "If someone's inconsiderate, they're not thinking about the feelings of other people.", "start": 47.42, "end": 53.0}, {"text": "Right, so for example, yesterday I was on the subway and it was full.", "start": 53.0, "end": 56.94}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 57.12, "end": 57.46}, {"text": "And an old lady was standing there and no one got up to give her their seat.", "start": 57.68, "end": 62.24}, {"text": "That was pretty inconsiderate.", "start": 62.44, "end": 64.22}, {"text": "Great, so now let's take a look at our second word and it's keep it down.", "start": 64.32, "end": 68.78}, {"text": "Keep it down.", "start": 68.98, "end": 69.84}, {"text": "Keep it down.", "start": 70.12, "end": 71.18}, {"text": "Keep it down.", "start": 71.34, "end": 72.44}, {"text": "So why don't we listen to some examples on how we use keep it down so we can understand.", "start": 72.76, "end": 78.08}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 80.48, "end": 81.36}, {"text": "Excuse me, do you mind keeping it down?", "start": 87.7, "end": 90.26}, {"text": "It's after midnight.", "start": 90.46, "end": 91.44}, {"text": "Okay, sorry.", "start": 92.48, "end": 93.56}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 98.68, "end": 99.62}, {"text": "I'm trying to study.", "start": 103.44, "end": 104.84}, {"text": "Do you mind keeping it down?", "start": 105.12, "end": 106.3}, {"text": "Example three.", "start": 110.78, "end": 111.58}, {"text": "Do you mind keeping it down?", "start": 115.80000000000001, "end": 117.04}, {"text": "I'm trying to watch the game.", "start": 117.26, "end": 118.3}, {"text": "So that means be quiet.", "start": 122.32000000000001, "end": 124.28}, {"text": "Yes, don't make so much noise.", "start": 124.56, "end": 126.0}, {"text": "I used to hear this one all the time from my mother.", "start": 126.24, "end": 128.84}, {"text": "I think we all did when we were children.", "start": 129.36, "end": 131.38}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 131.62, "end": 131.72}, {"text": "Okay, so now let's listen to the dialogue for the first time.", "start": 132.1, "end": 135.3}, {"text": "It's going to be kind of fast.", "start": 135.6, "end": 137.42}, {"text": "But don't worry about it if you can't understand everything.", "start": 137.58, "end": 140.42}, {"text": "By the end of today's lesson, you will understand this dialogue.", "start": 140.42, "end": 144.1}, {"text": "I'm trying to watch the game.", "start": 150.2, "end": 157.8}, {"text": "It's like a rat.", "start": 157.8, "end": 159.02}, {"text": "It's just a cheat.", "start": 159.02, "end": 159.92}, {"text": "It's like behind the scenes.", "start": 161.58, "end": 163.0}, {"text": "Those people in front of us are making so much noise.", "start": 163.26, "end": 165.86}, {"text": "It's so inconsiderate.", "start": 166.18, "end": 167.62}, {"text": "Don't worry about it.", "start": 167.86, "end": 169.02}, {"text": "It's not such a big deal.", "start": 169.14, "end": 170.28}, {"text": "No.", "start": 170.62, "end": 171.08}, {"text": "I can't hear a thing.", "start": 171.44, "end": 172.72}, {"text": "Excuse me, can you keep it down?", "start": 173.14, "end": 174.96}, {"text": "Sure.", "start": 175.64000000000001, "end": 176.12}, {"text": "Sorry about that.", "start": 176.54, "end": 177.18}, {"text": "What?", "start": 177.18, "end": 177.2}, {"text": "Someone's phone is ringing.", "start": 183.92, "end": 185.24}, {"text": "Honey, I think it's your phone.", "start": 185.96, "end": 188.02}, {"text": "Did you forget to switch it off?", "start": 188.24, "end": 189.52}, {"text": "Oh, no.", "start": 192.08, "end": 192.88}, {"text": "You're right.", "start": 193.4, "end": 194.18}, {"text": "That's so embarrassing.", "start": 194.9, "end": 196.36}, {"text": "Do you mind keeping it down?", "start": 196.62, "end": 197.64}, {"text": "I'm trying to watch a movie here.", "start": 197.64, "end": 199.2}, {"text": "Well, I hate it when people's phones ring when I'm watching a movie.", "start": 206.8, "end": 210.54}, {"text": "I think everyone gets kind of angry, but we're going to talk about this a little bit later.", "start": 211.16, "end": 216.06}, {"text": "Why don't we take a look now at our language takeaway?", "start": 216.24, "end": 219.14}, {"text": "Language takeaway.", "start": 221.12000000000003, "end": 222.08}, {"text": "So the language takeaway is our most important words for today's lesson.", "start": 223.06, "end": 228.56}, {"text": "And our first word today is...", "start": 228.72, "end": 231.54}, {"text": "Not such a big deal.", "start": 231.54, "end": 233.16}, {"text": "Not such a big deal.", "start": 233.32, "end": 235.38}, {"text": "Not such a big deal.", "start": 235.58, "end": 237.88}, {"text": "So when something is not a big deal, it's...", "start": 238.28, "end": 241.0}, {"text": "Not a big problem.", "start": 241.0, "end": 242.08}, {"text": "It's not important, right?", "start": 242.26, "end": 243.26}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 243.38, "end": 243.78}, {"text": "Okay, let's listen to some examples.", "start": 244.12, "end": 245.86}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 246.78, "end": 247.86}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 257.94, "end": 258.76}, {"text": "Uh, I'm really sorry.", "start": 262.32, "end": 264.4}, {"text": "I'm going to be ten minutes late for the meeting.", "start": 264.62, "end": 266.7}, {"text": "It's not such a big deal.", "start": 267.08, "end": 268.48}, {"text": "Peter and Liam are late too.", "start": 268.92, "end": 270.02}, {"text": "Now, let's look at our second word.", "start": 274.59999999999997, "end": 277.14}, {"text": "And it's...", "start": 277.18, "end": 278.02}, {"text": "Switch it off.", "start": 278.7, "end": 279.28}, {"text": "Switch it off.", "start": 279.42, "end": 280.48}, {"text": "Switch it off.", "start": 280.72, "end": 281.88}, {"text": "Switch it off.", "start": 282.04, "end": 283.28}, {"text": "So this word means to turn it off.", "start": 283.52, "end": 285.94}, {"text": "To turn something off.", "start": 286.06, "end": 287.22}, {"text": "Now, we can use it in three different ways.", "start": 287.38, "end": 289.86}, {"text": "Yeah, this one is a little bit complicated.", "start": 290.1, "end": 292.06}, {"text": "Because it changes a little bit depending on how you use it.", "start": 292.12, "end": 296.04}, {"text": "So, Marco, I think you've got some examples for us.", "start": 296.16, "end": 298.58}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 298.7, "end": 298.98}, {"text": "So, for example, I can say, did you switch off your phone?", "start": 298.98, "end": 303.36}, {"text": "Or you could say, did you switch your phone off?", "start": 303.52, "end": 306.7}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 307.08, "end": 307.56}, {"text": "Or simply, you can ask, did you switch it off?", "start": 307.72, "end": 310.7}, {"text": "I think this one is a little bit hard.", "start": 310.84, "end": 312.98}, {"text": "Let's look at a couple more examples.", "start": 313.26, "end": 315.44}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 315.78, "end": 316.14}, {"text": "So I can say, for example, switch off the TV.", "start": 316.3, "end": 319.8}, {"text": "Switch the TV off.", "start": 320.16, "end": 321.7}, {"text": "Or switch it off.", "start": 321.86, "end": 323.28}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 323.44, "end": 323.6}, {"text": "I think that's a little bit more clear.", "start": 323.6, "end": 325.24}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 325.34, "end": 325.52}, {"text": "But you know what?", "start": 325.72, "end": 326.34}, {"text": "We even had trouble with that one, didn't we?", "start": 326.34, "end": 328.26}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 328.44, "end": 328.8}, {"text": "We had to do it a couple of times.", "start": 328.98, "end": 330.86}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 331.32, "end": 331.8}, {"text": "Now, let's look at our last word.", "start": 332.26, "end": 334.0}, {"text": "And it's can't hear a thing.", "start": 334.18, "end": 336.36}, {"text": "Can't hear a thing.", "start": 336.68, "end": 337.84}, {"text": "I can't hear a thing.", "start": 338.2, "end": 339.66}, {"text": "Can't hear a thing.", "start": 339.94, "end": 340.96}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 341.26, "end": 341.54}, {"text": "We have some examples for this phrase.", "start": 341.54, "end": 343.4}, {"text": "So let's listen.", "start": 343.56, "end": 344.24}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 345.56, "end": 346.48}, {"text": "", "start": 346.48, "end": 346.48}, {"text": "What's going on in there?", "start": 350.02, "end": 351.42}, {"text": "I don't know.", "start": 351.76, "end": 352.78}, {"text": "I can't hear a thing.", "start": 353.02, "end": 354.3}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 357.1, "end": 357.96}, {"text": "What?", "start": 360.32, "end": 360.88}, {"text": "I'm sorry.", "start": 361.18, "end": 361.96}, {"text": "This music is too loud.", "start": 362.08, "end": 363.08}, {"text": "I can't hear a thing.", "start": 363.34, "end": 364.58}, {"text": "I can't hear a thing.", "start": 369.74, "end": 374.14}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 374.14, "end": 374.8}, {"text": "So now, we are ready to listen to our dialogue a second time.", "start": 375.06, "end": 378.8}, {"text": "It's going to be slower.", "start": 379.04, "end": 380.0}, {"text": "This time, listen for some of the key words we were explaining.", "start": 380.2, "end": 383.46}, {"text": "Those people in front of us are making so much noise.", "start": 386.46000000000004, "end": 390.6}, {"text": "It's so inconsiderate.", "start": 390.6, "end": 393.12}, {"text": "Don't worry about it.", "start": 393.8, "end": 395.7}, {"text": "It's not such a big deal.", "start": 395.82, "end": 397.48}, {"text": "I can't hear a thing.", "start": 397.48, "end": 400.06}, {"text": "Excuse me.", "start": 400.5, "end": 401.74}, {"text": "Can you keep it down?", "start": 402.08, "end": 403.64}, {"text": "Sure.", "start": 404.54, "end": 405.42}, {"text": "Sorry about that.", "start": 406.02, "end": 407.5}, {"text": "Someone's phone is ringing.", "start": 408.5, "end": 410.52}, {"text": "Honey, I think it's your phone.", "start": 411.28, "end": 414.14}, {"text": "Did you forget to switch it off?", "start": 414.4, "end": 416.58}, {"text": "Oh, no.", "start": 417.06, "end": 418.04}, {"text": "You're right.", "start": 418.84000000000003, "end": 419.66}, {"text": "That's so embarrassing.", "start": 420.12, "end": 422.42}, {"text": "Do you mind keeping it down?", "start": 422.88, "end": 424.86}, {"text": "I'm trying to watch a movie here.", "start": 424.86, "end": 427.82}, {"text": "Okay, great.", "start": 429.18, "end": 430.22}, {"text": "Now, with the dialogue slower, it's really understandable.", "start": 430.22, "end": 433.16}, {"text": "Yeah, I think you could catch those key words a lot better.", "start": 433.38, "end": 435.84}, {"text": "Perfect.", "start": 436.06, "end": 436.34}, {"text": "So now, we are ready to look at putting it together.", "start": 436.36, "end": 439.78}, {"text": "Putting it together.", "start": 441.8, "end": 443.04}, {"text": "So, in putting it together, we help you use a great phrase in different ways.", "start": 443.6, "end": 449.32}, {"text": "And today's phrase is, do you mind?", "start": 449.58, "end": 452.92}, {"text": "Do you mind?", "start": 453.18, "end": 454.22}, {"text": "Do you mind?", "start": 454.22, "end": 455.26}, {"text": "Okay, so let's listen to some examples on how you can use this phrase in different situations.", "start": 455.68, "end": 461.66}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 462.46, "end": 463.4}, {"text": "Do you mind holding my coat for me?", "start": 466.58, "end": 468.58}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 470.62, "end": 471.52}, {"text": "Oh, I forgot my wallet.", "start": 474.84, "end": 476.76}, {"text": "Do you mind paying for dinner?", "start": 477.08, "end": 477.96}, {"text": "Example three.", "start": 481.26, "end": 482.26}, {"text": "Example three.", "start": 483.54, "end": 484.14}, {"text": "Do you mind turning off your phone?", "start": 490.76, "end": 492.78}, {"text": "So, this phrase is usually pretty polite.", "start": 494.24, "end": 496.74}, {"text": "I could say to you, Marco, do you mind holding my coat for me?", "start": 496.98, "end": 500.72}, {"text": "And that's really polite.", "start": 500.86, "end": 501.74}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 501.9, "end": 502.02}, {"text": "So, would you mind?", "start": 502.18, "end": 503.14}, {"text": "Do you mind?", "start": 503.22, "end": 503.8}, {"text": "Are very polite phrases.", "start": 503.96, "end": 505.22}, {"text": "But, depending on your voice and how you use your tone, it could be a little bit sarcastic,", "start": 506.04, "end": 511.42}, {"text": "right?", "start": 511.54, "end": 511.7}, {"text": "Yeah, it could be a little bit rude if you say, would you mind keeping it down?", "start": 511.82, "end": 516.44}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 516.78, "end": 517.18}, {"text": "Like we heard in our dialogue.", "start": 517.24, "end": 518.6}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 518.88, "end": 519.04}, {"text": "So, that's not so polite.", "start": 519.04, "end": 520.42}, {"text": "Yeah, exactly.", "start": 520.66, "end": 521.32}, {"text": "I mean, in English, you have to be careful because your tone of voice tells the other", "start": 521.56, "end": 525.9}, {"text": "person how you're feeling.", "start": 525.9, "end": 527.12}, {"text": "If you're angry, sad, or just like in any other language.", "start": 527.12, "end": 529.8}, {"text": "Yeah, that's true.", "start": 530.04, "end": 530.76}, {"text": "So, I mean, using a phrase like, do you mind is a great phrase, but make sure you keep a", "start": 530.92, "end": 535.48}, {"text": "positive tone in your voice.", "start": 535.48, "end": 537.12}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 537.68, "end": 538.04}, {"text": "So, now that we've talked about all these great things, we can listen to the dialogue", "start": 538.04, "end": 543.32}, {"text": "a third time, but it'll be at its normal speed.", "start": 543.32, "end": 546.66}, {"text": "Those people in front of us are making so much noise.", "start": 560.8, "end": 563.38}, {"text": "It's so inconsiderate.", "start": 563.78, "end": 565.16}, {"text": "Don't worry about it.", "start": 565.4, "end": 566.56}, {"text": "It's not such a big deal.", "start": 566.68, "end": 567.78}, {"text": "So, uh...", "start": 568.04, "end": 568.42}, {"text": "No.", "start": 568.42, "end": 568.7}, {"text": "I can't hear a thing.", "start": 569.04, "end": 570.28}, {"text": "Excuse me, can you keep it down?", "start": 570.68, "end": 572.48}, {"text": "Sure.", "start": 573.18, "end": 573.66}, {"text": "Sorry about that.", "start": 574.06, "end": 574.74}, {"text": "Someone's phone is ringing.", "start": 581.5, "end": 582.74}, {"text": "Honey, I think it's your phone.", "start": 583.54, "end": 585.56}, {"text": "Did you forget to switch it off?", "start": 585.76, "end": 587.06}, {"text": "Oh, no.", "start": 589.66, "end": 590.42}, {"text": "You're right.", "start": 591.0, "end": 591.72}, {"text": "That's so embarrassing.", "start": 592.5, "end": 593.86}, {"text": "Do you mind keeping it down?", "start": 594.14, "end": 595.16}, {"text": "I'm trying to watch a movie here.", "start": 595.42, "end": 596.72}, {"text": "So, I know that in different countries, there are different habits about watching movies.", "start": 602.56, "end": 608.08}, {"text": "Yeah, that's definitely true.", "start": 608.44, "end": 609.9}, {"text": "Erica, what's it like in Canada?", "start": 610.04, "end": 611.36}, {"text": "Well, in Canada, it's really common to eat popcorn and candy and maybe chips while you're", "start": 611.56, "end": 617.54}, {"text": "watching a movie.", "start": 617.54, "end": 618.38}, {"text": "But if your phone rings in the movie theater, this is a big problem.", "start": 618.38, "end": 622.94}, {"text": "I imagine it is.", "start": 623.76, "end": 625.26}, {"text": "I mean, I would be upset also.", "start": 625.36, "end": 626.88}, {"text": "What about in Ecuador?", "start": 627.14, "end": 627.94}, {"text": "Well, in Ecuador and in South America, usually people can bring in food from the outside.", "start": 628.32, "end": 634.76}, {"text": "Really?", "start": 635.02, "end": 635.26}, {"text": "Yeah, so it's not really uncommon, depending on the city, to find people bringing in chicken", "start": 635.26, "end": 641.36}, {"text": "or some sort of like really smelly food.", "start": 641.36, "end": 644.4}, {"text": "No way.", "start": 644.56, "end": 645.04}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 645.04, "end": 645.06}, {"text": "So, you get either really hungry or really upset, but that's what happens.", "start": 645.6999999999999, "end": 650.04}, {"text": "You know, I used to live in Switzerland, and in Switzerland, you would have to eat before", "start": 650.2, "end": 654.12}, {"text": "you watch the movie.", "start": 654.12, "end": 655.12}, {"text": "There was no popcorn, no soda, no candy inside the movie theater.", "start": 655.3, "end": 659.74}, {"text": "Can you imagine that?", "start": 659.88, "end": 660.64}, {"text": "I could not live with that because the whole purpose of going to the movies is to have some", "start": 660.64, "end": 665.48}, {"text": "popcorn and relax and have a good time.", "start": 665.48, "end": 667.7}, {"text": "You can't have a movie without popcorn.", "start": 667.8, "end": 669.4}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 669.4, "end": 669.96}, {"text": "Okay, so we've talked a lot about how to ask someone to be quiet today, and I hope that", "start": 670.38, "end": 675.56}, {"text": "you'll go out and try a few of these phrases in your daily life.", "start": 675.56, "end": 679.04}, {"text": "Yes, and I hope also that you visit our website at englishpod.com and leave all your questions", "start": 679.3, "end": 685.3}, {"text": "and comments.", "start": 685.3, "end": 685.98}, {"text": "Marco and I are there every day, so we'll be happy to answer your questions.", "start": 686.22, "end": 689.62}, {"text": "But until next time, bye.", "start": 689.9, "end": 692.18}, {"text": "", "start": 699.4, "end": 699.4}, {"text": "", "start": 699.68, "end": 699.68}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 699.8, "end": 700.04}, {"text": "", "start": 700.04, "end": 700.04}, {"text": "", "start": 700.04, "end": 700.04}, {"text": "", "start": 700.04, "end": 700.04}, {"text": "", "start": 700.04, "end": 700.04}, {"text": "", "start": 700.04, "end": 700.04}, {"text": "", "start": 700.04, "end": 700.04}, {"text": "", "start": 700.04, "end": 700.04}, {"text": "", "start": 700.04, "end": 700.04}, {"text": "", "start": 700.04, "end": 700.04}, {"text": "", "start": 700.04, "end": 700.04}, {"text": "", "start": 700.04, "end": 700.04}, {"text": "", "start": 700.04, "end": 700.04}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 700.16, "end": 700.22}, {"text": "", "start": 700.22, "end": 700.22}, {"text": "", "start": 700.22, "end": 700.22}, {"text": "", "start": 700.22, "end": 700.22}, {"text": "", "start": 700.22, "end": 700.22}, {"text": "", "start": 700.22, "end": 700.22}, {"text": "", "start": 700.22, "end": 700.22}, {"text": "", "start": 700.22, "end": 700.22}, {"text": "", "start": 700.22, "end": 700.22}, {"text": "", "start": 700.22, "end": 700.22}, {"text": "", "start": 700.22, "end": 700.22}, {"text": "", "start": 700.22, "end": 700.22}, {"text": "", "start": 700.22, "end": 700.22}, {"text": "", "start": 700.22, "end": 700.22}, {"text": "", "start": 700.22, "end": 700.22}]